COPYING — license notices for the files in harfbuzzjs/
======================================================

This directory self-hosts the HarfBuzz-in-WebAssembly runtime behind rsvp.html's
JS-console shape() command, plus a Fraunces shaping font. Provenance, versions and
sha256s are in harfbuzzjs/README.md; the full license texts follow the table.

Shipped file            Component / version                     License                       Upstream source
----------------------  --------------------------------------  ----------------------------  ------------------------------------------
hb.wasm                 HarfBuzz 14.0.0, compiled to WASM       "Old MIT" (HarfBuzz)          https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz
                        (shipped inside harfbuzzjs 0.10.3)
hb.js                   harfbuzzjs 0.10.3 Emscripten loader     MIT (harfbuzzjs); bundled     https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzzjs
hbjs.js                 harfbuzzjs 0.10.3 high-level wrapper    Zephyr libc bits Apache-2.0;  https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzzjs
                                                                Emscripten emmalloc MIT
fraunces.ttf            Fraunces Regular latin subset (v38)     OFL-1.1                       https://github.com/undercasetype/Fraunces

Notes:
- hb.wasm is a compiled build of HarfBuzz 14.0.0; the HarfBuzz "Old MIT" license and its
  copyright notices apply to it and are reproduced in full below.
- hb.js / hbjs.js are from the npm package harfbuzzjs@0.10.3 (npm shasum
  fcd53cc888548d16607f19e4cab8d1b55dceb939). The package's own LICENSE (MIT, with the
  Zephyr libc files under Apache-2.0 and Emscripten's emmalloc under MIT) is reproduced
  in full below, as pinned at 0.10.3.
- Apache-2.0 (for the Zephyr libc bits) full text:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- fraunces.ttf is a subset of Fraunces (no Reserved Font Name), under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, reproduced in full below.


